# EKP-TS11 — Testing cost must match change risk

> **Source:** `knowledge/testing/testing.md`

## Directives

- Testing effort is proportional to blast radius, lifespan, and change frequency—not uniform across all code.
- Testing budget is negotiated like refactoring budget (**EKP-RF04** reference only).

